Sanka Migrate monorepo — per-component licensing
================================================

This repository contains packages under different licenses. The
SPDX-License-Identifier header in each source file is authoritative.

  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka/runtime/       AGPL-3.0-only
  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka/cli/           AGPL-3.0-only
  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka/_client.py     AGPL-3.0-only
  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka/connector/     Apache-2.0
  packages/sanka-migrate/src/sanka_connector_*/   Apache-2.0
  packages/sanka-migrate-mcp/                      Apache-2.0
  connectors/, scripts/, tests/, docs/             Apache-2.0

The `sanka-migrate` wheel includes both full license texts and a NOTICE file.
Source-file SPDX headers identify which license governs each component.

The Sanka Migrate Runtime (packages/sanka-migrate) is also available under a
commercial license from Sanka, Inc. for use without AGPL-3.0 obligations —
see docs/legal/commercial-license.md (draft).

All contributions require a signed Contributor License Agreement; see
CONTRIBUTING.md.
